{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/aliyah-residences-azizi-al-jaddaf","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":430,"crm_id":"1693","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Aliyah Residences","slug":"aliyah-residences-azizi-al-jaddaf","display_address":"Al Jaddaf","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"Ready","developer":"Azizi Developments","price":1410400,"display_price":"1.41M","lattitude":25.2126011,"longitude":55.2888338,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Aliyah Residences is a luxuriously designed 18-storey complex of <strong>studios and 1 - 2 bedroom apartments</strong> by Azizi Developments in Dubai Health City. The first floor of the building houses commercial spaces. Each residence has panoramic glazing, spacious terrace, turnkey finishing, fully furnished.</p><p>To increase the comfort of living, the residential complex is equipped with high-speed elevators, automated waste disposal system and centralized air conditioning system. At the service of the owners of the apartments are provided: 24-hour concierge service, covered parking, communal swimming pool, equipped gym, sauna and steam room inside the building. The landscaped adjacent territory has a playground, barbecue area, landscaped gardens. The building is guarded round the clock.</p><p>The infrastructure of the area is well developed, there are many world-class medical clinics, schools, supermarkets, boutiques, also in the neighborhood there are many entertainment venues. On Sheikh Zayed Road for 25 minutes residents get to the main attractions of the emirate: the tower Burj Khalifa, the world's largest shopping center Dubai Mall, opera house, singing fountains. It will take the same amount of time to get to Kite Beach on the Persian Gulf. The airport can be reached in half an hour. Discovery Gardens Metro Station is a 13-minute walk from the hotel.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1693/images/2024/04/22/oXlxTz0HaHtDnjypNgNCH5bhukQthYca05LVzwah.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/22/oXlxTz0HaHtDnjypNgNCH5bhukQthYca05LVzwah.png","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1693/images/2024/04/22/1oTYcqxzlXFhk7NNA39NYfLny0sJPjwaciQaX1S6.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/22/1oTYcqxzlXFhk7NNA39NYfLny0sJPjwaciQaX1S6.png","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1693/images/2024/04/22/wnsgHLms9dLiODGY2SSfhNigYcp8h0PiyBfOK1B6.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/22/wnsgHLms9dLiODGY2SSfhNigYcp8h0PiyBfOK1B6.png","__ggfxIndex":2}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2640,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2024/04/22/Zbu9naqFvGFW1KtHl1LXATSxKDB8up956B9FE1Pz.pdf","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1340,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":1425,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"Studio","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1426,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"1 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1427,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"2 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null}],"payment_plan_text":"20/80","payment_plans":[{"id":6674,"title":"20%","description":"On Booking"},{"id":6675,"title":"80%","description":"On Handover"}],"community":"Al Jaddaf","publish":1,"currency":"AED","amenities":[{"id":11550,"url":null,"text":"Covered Parking","type":null,